@HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health check
GET {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Register (201 the first time, 409 if you run it again; 429 after 10 sign-ups in an hour)
POST {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "displayName": "Alice"
}

### Register with bad input (400 with validation errors)
POST {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short",
  "displayName": ""
}

### Login – copy "token" from the response into @token below
# @name login
POST {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login with a wrong password (401). Run it 6 times in a minute → 429.
# An email with no account also gets 401, with the same message and about the same response time.
POST {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

###
@token = paste-your-token-here

### Me with the token (200 + your user)
GET {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Me without a token (401)
GET {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

### ----- Habits (all need @token from a login above) -----

### List my active habits
GET {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a habit (scheduleDays 62 = Mon–Fri, see frontend/src/utils/schedule.ts)
POST {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Read 10 pages",
  "emoji": "📚",
  "color": "#3b82f6",
  "scheduleDays": 62,
  "startDate": "2026-10-13"
}

### Create with bad input (400: name, color and scheduleDays errors)
POST {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "emoji": "📚",
  "color": "blue",
  "scheduleDays": 0
}

###
@habitId = paste-a-habit-id-here

### Update a habit (PUT sends the whole habit)
PUT {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Read 20 pages",
  "description": "Before bed",
  "emoji": "📖",
  "color": "#a855f7",
  "scheduleDays": 127
}

### Archive a habit (204; it disappears from the list but stays in the database)
DELETE {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ----- Check-ins (any member, for themselves) -----
# Use your local date for both the day and ?today=. PUT and DELETE are idempotent: run them twice, same result.

### Check in for a day (204)
PUT {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/checkins/2026-10-13?today=2026-10-13
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Undo a check-in (204, even if there was none)
DELETE {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/checkins/2026-10-13
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A future day (400)
PUT {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/checkins/2099-01-01?today=2026-10-13
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Habits with stats (streaks, 30-day rate, last 7 days) for your local today
GET {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits?today=2026-10-13
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ----- Sharing: invites and partners -----

### Create an invite (owner only; 409 if the habit already has a partner). Copy "code" below.
POST {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@inviteCode = paste-an-invite-code-here

### Preview an invite (works without a token; 410 if expired or used)
GET {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/invites/{{inviteCode}}

### Accept an invite (log in as a *different* user first and use their token)
POST {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/invites/{{inviteCode}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@memberUserId = paste-a-user-id-here

### Remove a partner (owner) or leave (your own user id)
DELETE {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/members/{{memberUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
